# Public temp assets
# NOTE: Vite's `public/` directory is NOT temporary — it is copied verbatim
# into dist/ and is the source of sw.js, manifest.json and quickstart.html.
# Leaving this ignored meant the whole PWA (manifest + service worker) was
# never committed and therefore never deployed. Only genuinely scratch files
# should be excluded here.
public/*.tmp
public/**/*.tmp

